{"text":"Strong RSI means an open-ended loop where the system improves its own capabilities faster than humans could with little human oversight. I'd put that at about five percent by year-end. The best current evidence is that agents are good at research engineering but weak at open-ended research. A July survey of one thousand two hundred and fifty papers found open-ended RSI still bounded by grounding, collapse dynamics, and compute on every measured axis.","words":[["Strong",0.16,0.46],["RSI",0.6,1.08],["means",1.18,1.36],["an",1.38,1.52],["open-ended",1.6,2.18],["loop",2.26,2.5],["where",2.74,2.86],["the",2.9,3],["system",3.04,3.36],["improves",3.44,3.88],["its",3.94,4.12],["own",4.2,4.4],["capabilities",4.44,5.12],["faster",5.42,5.82],["than",5.84,5.96],["humans",6.02,6.32],["could",6.4,6.64],["with",6.94,7.12],["little",7.2,7.5],["human",7.54,7.8],["oversight.",7.92,8.44],["I'd",9.24,9.36],["put",9.4,9.54],["that",9.6,9.82],["at",9.86,9.92],["about",9.98,10.3],["five",10.34,10.54],["percent",10.62,11.02],["by",11.04,11.18],["year-end.",11.22,11.72],["The",12.44,12.54],["best",12.58,12.84],["current",12.96,13.22],["evidence",13.28,13.66],["is",13.76,13.84],["that",13.9,14.04],["agents",14.1,14.42],["are",14.46,14.62],["good",14.66,14.88],["at",14.92,15.08],["research",15.12,15.48],["engineering",15.54,16.06],["but",16.36,16.54],["weak",16.6,16.88],["at",16.92,17.08],["open-ended",17.16,17.78],["research.",17.86,18.34],["A",19.28,19.34],["July",19.38,19.68],["survey",19.8,20.18],["of",20.24,20.36],["one",20.46,20.6],["thousand",20.62,20.98],["two",21.02,21.16],["hundred",21.2,21.44],["and",21.46,21.52],["fifty",21.62,21.84],["papers",21.94,22.38],["found",22.58,22.8],["open-ended",22.96,23.54],["RSI",23.68,24.2],["still",24.44,24.72],["bounded",24.76,25.14],["by",25.18,25.32],["grounding,",25.38,25.86],["collapse",26.16,26.56],["dynamics,",26.6,27.14],["and",27.26,27.36],["compute",27.44,27.92],["on",28.22,28.46],["every",28.54,28.82],["measured",28.96,29.3],["